# Trivy IaC checks to ignore — intentional by design, not security gaps.
#
# The tenant-controller operator MUST manage secrets, services, endpoints,
# networkpolicies, and ingresses to provision and manage tenant namespaces.
# These permissions are required by the system design (spec §7).

# ClusterRole 'tenant-controller' needs access to secrets for tenant provisioning
KSV-0041

# ClusterRole 'tenant-controller' needs broad resource access for namespace management
KSV-0056

# Container image CVE suppressions.
